#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:0 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:0 
msgid "ん、どうした？\n"
msgstr "Hm, what's up?\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:1 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:1 
msgid "……なに？\n前任者の遺言はどうなったかって？\n"
msgstr ""
"...What?\n"
"You want to know more about what\n"
"my predecessor was talking about?\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:2 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:2 
msgid "おつき２の遺言……ああ、あれか。\n地球の生命体にアンテナを付ける話だな？\n"
msgstr ""
"Otsuki #2... Ah, right.\n"
"He wanted us to stream the\n"
"earthlings, right?\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:3 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:3 
msgid "それなら丁度よかった。\n今まさに取り付けていたところだ。ほら弌弌\n"
msgstr ""
"You've got perfect timing then,\n"
"I was just setting that up.\n"
"Look, here it is.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:4 
msgid "校長先生"
msgstr "Principal"

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:4 
msgid "あ、あなたたちは何者ですか！？\n……が、学校の敷地に無断で弌弌ひっ！？\n"
msgstr ""
"Hey, who are you guys?!\n"
"...You, are you on school\n"
"grounds without permission?!\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:5 
msgid "校長先生"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:5 
msgid "ひぎゃあああ―っ！？\n"
msgstr "Gyaaaahh!?\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:6 
msgid "校長先生"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:6 
msgid "………………。\n"
msgstr ".........\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:7 
msgid "校長先生"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:7 
msgid "……コントロ―ル電波……受信……\n受信……受信……。\n"
msgstr ""
"...Control signal...receiving...\n"
"...receiving...receiving...\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:8 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:8 
msgid "………………。\n"
msgstr ""

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:9 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:9 
msgid "今見た事は気にするな。\nおそらく問題ない……はずだ。\n"
msgstr ""
"Don't worry about what you just saw.\n"
"I'm sure it's fine...probably.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:10 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:10 
msgid "さて、準備が終わったところで、\nアンテナについて説明させてもらおう。\n"
msgstr ""
"Now, with everything set up,\n"
"I'll explain how the antennas work.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:11 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:11 
msgid "今回の計画では、今のアンテナを取り付けた\n生命体の力を借りてＫＨＵＤ中継を行う。\n"
msgstr ""
"Our plan is to use the power of the\n"
"lifeforms currently wearing the\n"
"antennas to broadcast LIVE.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:12 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:12 
msgid "ちなみにアンテナの装着者は全部で三人だ。\n"
msgstr ""
"By the way, there are three people\n"
"wearing antennas in total.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:13 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:13 
msgid "君の元にも情報が行っていたと思うが弌弌\nお、残りの二人も完了したらしいな。\n"
msgstr ""
"I believe you've already been informed, but...\n"
"Oh, it seems the other two have finished as well.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:14 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:14 
msgid "それでは、あらためて見たまえ。\nこれが地球を代表する三人の生命体だ！\n"
msgstr ""
"Now, take another look.\n"
"These are the three lifeforms representing Earth!\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:15 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:15 
msgid "………………。\n"
msgstr "……………….\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:16 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:16 
msgid "オ、オホン。この三人……いや三体が、\n地球の生命体を代表したアンテナ装着者だ。\n"
msgstr ""
"A-ahem. These three people...\n"
"Rather, these three beings, are the\n"
"antenna wearers representing Earth.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:17 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:17 
msgid "この３つのうち、どのアンテナで放送するかは\n中継する地球人を選んだ後に決定される。\n"
msgstr ""
"Which of these three antennas will be\n"
"used for broadcasting will be determined\n"
"after selecting the human relay operator.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:18 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:18 
msgid "表示されている通り、装着者の差で効果にも\n差が生まれるが……それは後で説明する。\n"
msgstr ""
"As you saw, the effect varies depending\n"
"on the wearer...but I'll explain that later.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:19 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:19 
msgid "まずはこのグラフ。この面積が大きいほど\n選びやすいアンテナだと覚えてくれ。\n"
msgstr ""
"First, look at this graph.\n"
"Remember, the larger the area,\n"
"the easier it is to choose an antenna.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:20 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:20 
msgid "ちなみにグラフは装着者のコンディションや\nＫＨＵＤ中継を行う場所で変化するぞ。\n"
msgstr ""
"Keep in mind that the graph changes\n"
"depending on the wearer's condition\n"
"and the location where LIVE relay is performed.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:21 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:21 
msgid "さて、ここまでは大丈夫だな？\nアンテナで重要なのはここからだぞ。\n"
msgstr ""
"Okay, you got all that so far, right?\n"
"The most important part about\n"
"the antennas starts here.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:22 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:22 
msgid "グラフや情報を確認したらボタンを押す。\nそれでル―レット開始だ。\n"
msgstr ""
"After checking the graph and information,\n"
"press the confirm button. That's how you\n"
"start the roulette.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:23 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:23 
msgid "好きに選んでも良いのだが、\nこれもまあ番組を盛り上げる演出の１つだ。\n"
msgstr ""
"You can choose whichever you like,\n"
"this is just one of the ways the show\n"
"livens things up.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:24 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:24 
msgid "ル―レットでは、まずグラフが\nシャッフルされる。\n"
msgstr "In roulette, the graph is first shuffled.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:25 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:25 
msgid "シャッフルが終了すると、グラフの\n面積比にあわせたル―レットに変化するぞ。\n"
msgstr ""
"Once the shuffling is complete,\n"
"the roulette will change to match\n"
"the area ratio of the graph.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:26 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:26 
msgid "そしていよいよアンテナ装着者の決定。\nル―レットのスタ―トだ。\n"
msgstr ""
"And finally, the person who will wear\n"
"the antenna is decided.\n"
"The roulette begins.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:27 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:27 
msgid "ル―レットが回り始めた後は、\nどのアンテナにするかを決めるだけ。\n"
msgstr ""
"Once the roulette wheel starts spinning,\n"
"all you have to do is choose an antenna.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:28 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:28 
msgid "この最終決定は、プロデュ―サ―であるお前に\n行ってもらうぞ。\n"
msgstr ""
"This final decision is yours to make,\n"
"as the producer.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 1 
#: sc/0209:29 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 1 
#: sc/0209:29 
msgid "な―に、やり方は簡単だ。\n止めたい場所を狙ってボタン！\n"
msgstr ""
"What's the holdup? It's easy.\n"
"Just aim at where you want to stop and press the button!\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:30 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr ""

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:30 
msgid "これでアンテナ装着者が決まり、\nＫＨＵＤ中継がスタ―トする。\n"
msgstr ""
"This determines who will wear the antenna,\n"
"and the LIVE broadcast can begin.\n"

#  speaker 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:31 
msgid "おつき３"
msgstr "Otsuki #3"

#  text 
#  warnings: 0 
#: sc/0209:31 
msgid "……以上だ。\nではアンテナ装着者の決定に挑んでくれ！\n"
msgstr ""
"...That's all there is to it.\n"
"Now, it's time to select the antenna wearer!\n"
